00:03:59,380 --> 00:04:10,090
Speaker 3: Several years ago I tried to name the Berkeley Post Office after Maudel. While this body has a tradition of supporting post office bills in a bipartisan way, Congressman Steve King from Iowa came

21
00:04:10,090 --> 00:04:22,650
Speaker 2: to this floor and tried to tarnish her character. He brought groundless accusations and this body voted against, mind you, against naming the post office in my district after this great icon.

22
00:04:22,590 --> 00:04:22,660
I

23
